<title>PERU: Peru financial markets closed Friday for holiday.</title>
<headline>Peru financial markets closed Friday for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's banks, financial markets and the Lima Stock Exchange will be closed all day Friday due to a national holiday.</p>
<p>They will re-open Monday.</p>
<p>-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
